# Optional: enables LIVE Google Reviews in the Testimonials section.
#
# 1. Create a project at https://console.cloud.google.com/
# 2. Enable "Maps JavaScript API" (and billing) for that project.
# 3. Create an API key, then restrict it (HTTP referrers) to your real domain.
# 4. Copy this file to ".env" and paste your key below.
#
# Without this key, the Testimonials section simply falls back to the
# reviews saved in src/data/testimonials.json — nothing breaks.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
